OL,3,ABoy, 7, pulled alive from rubble hours 
OL,4,Aafter Russian strike on Ukraine,       
OL,5,Arescuers say                           
OL,7,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky 
OL,8,Falso said three people were killed and 
OL,9,F13 wounded in a separate strike on     
OL,10,FVyshneve, also in the Kyiv region, that
OL,11,Fhit a grocery store on Sunday.         
